{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1388058-infernal","id":1388058,"title":"Infernal","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-13T08:46:36-07:00","id":1388058,"title":"Infernal","content":"I'm considering having a Infernal Cult in my Chronicle as a minor faction....provide &quot;filler plot&quot; once in awhile. I don't have WoD Infernal, I am curious how it lines up with MtAw Lower Depths Infernal. Are they the same Infernal Realm and entities? Or they different takes on a same concept? Is Summoners a good source for info on this subject? And if so, what kind of milage does that sourcebook provide for that subject? I image The Fallen World will provide more info on this....but tbh....that source book is probably 5 years away before publication....smh...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T09:51:35-07:00","id":1388071,"title":"","content":"The Inferno is the original face of the Lower Depths before squaring away the mild contradiction between Inferno/Imperial Mysteries and Summoners/Left-Hand Path made it merely a very prominent subset of them. You'll get much more mileage out of Inferno if you're looking for specifically Infernal <i>akathartoi</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T10:17:21-07:00","id":1388080,"title":"","content":"Thanx for the info. So Infernal is worth looking into for this particular part of the Fallen World? And how do the akathartoi stack up against Mages? Is there various versions of the akathartoi? Does Spirit Arcanum influence them? I am going to look into the Infernal PDF. Asking the questions till I can get it lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T10:24:16-07:00","id":1388081,"title":"","content":"It might also be worth looking at the 101 Exarch Cults topic, I wouldn't be surprised if there was one that leveraged some kind of bargain with that Lower Depth. You can find it here:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1319624-101-exarch-cults\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...1-exarch-cults</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 05-13-2020, 01:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T12:11:00-07:00","id":1388108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mahjemm01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1388058-infernal?p=1388080#post1388080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanx for the info. So Infernal is worth looking into for this particular part of the Fallen World? And how do the akathartoi stack up against Mages? Is there various versions of the akathartoi? Does Spirit Arcanum influence them? I am going to look into the Infernal PDF. Asking the questions till I can get it lol.</div> </div> </div> </div>Akathartoi aren't necessarily spirits, they can also be formed from corrupted ghosts and goetia, as well as spirits. They stack up against Mages pretty much the same as any ephemeral entity, typically a Mage, especially one with the right arcana, will walk all over them in direct conflict. They're better off not fighting Mages though and seducing them instead, because they can generate some pretty sweet deals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T15:26:28-07:00","id":1388165,"title":"","content":"All of y'all have been outstanding with the help y'all have been offering. I do appreciate that immensely. And this has really inspired me to look deeper into this. Possibly even making what was going to be originally a side plot/filler and turn it into a Chronicle Metaplot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}